
Task: Switching between multiple browser windows (Herokuapp)

Steps:
1. Go to "https://the-internet.herokuapp.com/windows".
2. Click the "Click Here" link to open a new window.
3. Switch to the newly opened window.
4. Assert that the new window heading says "New Window".
5. Switch back to the original window and assert that its title is "The Internet".
6. Close all windows.
